{"t":"Deed of Ownership (Book)","s":"deed-of-ownership-book-4eb04","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Document_Certificate_bb7072.gif","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Deed of Ownership</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Document (Certificate)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Document_Certificate_bb7072.gif\" width=\"32\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"location\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Location</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p><a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a>'s reward room (<a href=\"#/wiki/Kazordoon\">Kazordoon</a>).</p></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"blurb\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Short Description</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">A deed awarded to lightbearers who show great effort.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"author\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Author</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"relatedpages\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Related Articles</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/quest/the-lightbearer\">The Lightbearer</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Santa%20Claus\">Santa Claus</a>, Blazebringer</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"returnpage\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Return to</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p>Kazordoon Libraries.</p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Libraries <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>None.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-book-text\">\n<blockquote class=\"book\"><p><br/>Deed of Ownership<br/>\nHaving opened this chest enables you to receive a very special present from Santa this year. Deed does not need to be presented and will not have any effect for other adventurers if passed on.</p></blockquote>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","quests":["the-lightbearer"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"the-lightbearer","quest":"The Lightbearer","step":"3-3","n":22,"title":"Recolher as mochilas","kind":"mention","coords":[]}]}}